# Related Articles — PDF files

Place English PDF files here. They are served at `/documents/articles/<filename>.pdf`.

Expected filenames (update `src/constants/articles.ts` if you use different names):

| File | Article |
|------|---------|
| `catholic-laity-involvement-sep-2011.pdf` | I. Catholic Laity Involvement in Church Building Project |
| `mount-carmel-laity-involvement-june-2013.pdf` | II. Mount Carmel Church, Wanchai |
| `catholic-laity-involvement-iii.pdf` | III. (update title in constants when confirmed) |
| `catholic-laity-involvement-iv.pdf` | IV. (update title in constants when confirmed) |

Sprint 1: static files in this folder — no Supabase required.

Sprint 2 (optional): store PDFs in Supabase Storage and load metadata from a database table; the page component can stay the same if the API returns the same `ArticlePdf` shape.
